3. Build the entire application from scratch.
4. Do not create fake production data.
5. Do not leave placeholder pages.
6. Do not leave non-functional buttons.
7. Do not use localStorage as a production database.
8. Do not expose sensitive credentials.
9. Do not allow unauthorized financial access.
10. Do not create any shareholder by default.
11. Main Admin must initially own 100%.
12. Main Admin must control shareholder creation and ownership changes.
13. Total active ownership must always equal 100%.
14. Do not silently change ownership percentages.
15. Do not confuse investment with business revenue.
16. Fingerprint authentication must use real WebAuthn/Passkeys.
17. Never store raw fingerprint data.
18. Biometric enrollment must only be available after account approval.
19. Push notifications must use real supported delivery mechanisms.
20. Do not claim a notification was delivered without successful provider confirmation.
21. All business modules must use the same persistent database.
22. All financial calculations must be accurate.
23. All important actions must be logged.
24. The entire application must be responsive.
25. The POS and thermal printing workflow must be production-oriented.
26. Do not claim completion until the actual workflows have been tested.

